message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Darmiyan: Time as the Cost of Incomplete Self-Reference"
abstract: >-
  Formalism and reproduction code for the Darmiyan framework: proper duration as
  coordinate time filtered by non-return, phi as the minimal departure from identity
  that still generates a sequence, irreversibility separated from entropy production,
  and controlled filesystem measurements of self-referential traversal cost.
